* **Mechanism:** `NSEvent::addLocalMonitorForEventsMatchingMask_handler` returns an allocated monitor token (`Retained<AnyObject>`). If re-invoked on window recreation or not retained across the application lifetime, either duplicate monitors accumulate or the monitor gets prematurely unregistered.
